    <selectionEntry name="[E] - Lucrezzia Belladonna, la mujer más hermosa de Tilea " id="5ae9-e729-2c9f-8c80" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="unit">
      <categoryLinks>
        <categoryLink name="Comandantes" id="da34-23b3-d773-810b" hidden="false" primary="true" targetId="4c6f72647323232344415441232323"/>
        <categoryLink name="Personajes" id="7a3b-bcde-09ce-d5b8" hidden="false" primary="false" targetId="e839-bd6b-7e36-e758"/>
